1. What is Mockito?
Answer
Mockito is a Java mocking framework used to create mock objects and test classes in isolation without calling actual dependencies.
 
@Mock

EmployeeRepository repository;
 
Interview One-Liner
Mockito helps unit test a class by mocking its dependencies.
