      .thenReturn(employee);
 
8. Difference Between thenReturn() and thenAnswer()?
Answer
thenReturn()
Fixed value.
 
when(service.getName())

      .thenReturn("Parag");
 
thenAnswer()
Dynamic value using arguments.
 
when(service.getName(anyString()))

      .thenAnswer(i -> i.getArgument(0));
 
